<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_exec">ActionExec</link></para>

<para>This class handles the execution of specific actions based on the content of a file. The actions include quitting the application or reloading it. The actions are read from a file whose path is provided by the global <computeroutput>$bearsamppCore</computeroutput> object. </para>
<para>
