<anchor xml:id="_class_action_exec_1a57b60b4976a2c5d1e40f2d11aa72aa7d"/><section>
    <title>__construct()</title>
<indexterm><primary>__construct</primary><secondary>ActionExec</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>ActionExec</primary><secondary>__construct</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>__construct ( $args)</computeroutput></para>
<para><link linkend="_class_action_exec">ActionExec</link> constructor.</para>

<para>This constructor reads the action from a file specified by <computeroutput>$bearsamppCore-&gt;getExec()</computeroutput>. If the action is &apos;quit&apos;, it calls <computeroutput><link linkend="_class_batch_1aca27f962f806f8bce07383b0b0b60a39">Batch\exitApp()</link></computeroutput>. If the action is &apos;restart&apos;, it calls <computeroutput><link linkend="_class_batch_1aec4e90053a1b80c468077e8f76544b8f">Batch\restartApp()</link></computeroutput>. After executing the action, it deletes the action file.</para>

